# Fixture registry: `person` with no owner — the shape that must never be a valid spelling, because an
# unowned person reference IS the violation. A parser that degraded it to non-person would turn the whole
# axis into documentation; one that degraded a capitalisation slip the same way would do it silently.
Erpify\Tests\Unit\Gate\Fixture\PersonReference\PersonReferenceFixtureEntity::$subjectId => person
Erpify\Tests\Unit\Gate\Fixture\PersonReference\PersonReferenceFixtureEntity::$tenantId => non-person
